#basePath	Day3

:: Day3Start
@trigger    Day3Start
@who        Player
@once

$call PlaceAndRotatePlayerAt(WarpDesk, true)
$call SetAllWarpsActive(false)

$call Wait(2)

{@Margo}   Mornin’, kiddo! You’re up awfully early.   $[Day3/Tent/Margo_1]
{@Player}   I was too excited to sleep.   $[Day3/Tent/Player_1]
{@Player}   Some of the eggs have probably already hatched!  $[Day3/Tent/Player_2]
{@Player}   I hope Alfredo’s doing okay. $[Day3/Tent/Player_3]
{@Player}   And hopefully Fuzz has figured things out by now . . . I don’t know what he was thinking yesterday.  $[Day3/Tent/Player_4]
{@Margo}   What happened to not playin’ favorites?     $[Day3/Tent/Margo_2]
{@Player}   Oh, uh . . . I just . . .    $[Day3/Tent/Player_5]
{@Margo}   Ha. Relax, kiddo, I’m teasin’.     $[Day3/Tent/Margo_3]
{@Margo}    Let’s get out there and see how your Fabulous Five are doin’.    $[Day3/Tent/Margo_5]

$call SetWarpActive(WarpBluff, true)
$call Wait(1)

$call CreateGoal("Day3_outside", Use Warp to go outside)
$call SetWarpActive(WarpBluff, true)

:: WarpedOutsideTent
@trigger    AtWarpPoint
@who        Player
@when       targetObject == "WarpTarget-Bluff"
@once

$call CompleteGoal("Day3_outside")

$call Wait(1)

$call SetWarpActive(WarpBluff, false)

$call SetWarpGroupActive(Rookery, true)
$call CreateGoal("Day3_rookery", Use Warp to enter rookery)

{@Player}   What’s on our list for today?  $[Day3/Bluff/Player_1]
{@Margo}   We need to get some data on those chicks, and see how the parents are doin'.   $[Day3/Bluff/Margo_1]
{@Margo}    Let’s head down to the Rookery. Looks like Penny is already there.   $[Day3/Bluff/Margo_2]

:: WarpedToRookery
@trigger    AtWarpPoint
@who        Player
@when       targetObject == "WarpTarget-Rookery"
@once

$call CompleteGoal("Day3_rookery")

$call Wait(1)

//$call SetWarpActive(WarpBluffBack, true)
$call SetWarpGroupActive(Rookery, true)

$call ClearGoals()

{@Player}   Oh. My. God. They’re amazing! $[Day3/Rookery/Player_1]
{@Partner}   Hey there, new kid. $[Day3/Rookery/Partner_1]
{@Partner}   Pretty extraordinary, aren’t they?   $[Day3/Rookery/Partner_2]
{@Partner}  This is our favorite time of year around here.   $[Day3/Rookery/Partner_3]
{@Player}   The skua are pretty active today   $[Day3/Rookery/Player_2]
{@Partner}   They drive me crazy. They’re pretty nasty. $[Day3/Rookery/Partner_4]
{@Partner}  Harmless to adult penguins, but they love a nice breakfast of penguin chicks and eggs.  $[Day3/Rookery/Partner_5]
{@Partner}   At the South Pole?? How?    $[Day3/Rookery/Partner_6]
{@Player}  They look like they are hunting today. These poor chicks. $[Day3/Rookery/Player_3]
{@Player}   I want to help them.  $[Day3/Rookery/Player_4]
{@Partner}    Help the chicks? Yeah, I wish.  $[Day3/Rookery/Partner_7]
{@Partner}    We cant interfere.  $[Day3/Rookery/Partner_8]
{@Partner}    You just keep an eye on your—what did you call them? $[Day3/Rookery/Partner_9]
{@Player}    Oh, uh… the Fliptastic Five? $[Day3/Rookery/Player_5]
{@Partner}   Right. Take a look at which eggs hatched and how the chicks are doing.  $[Day3/Rookery/Partner_10]
{@Partner}  You’ll also need to document what tshe parents are feeding their chicks. $[Day3/Rookery/Partner_11]
{@Player}   Got it. $[Day3/Rookery/Player_6]
{@Partner}  Oh… and you don’t know what happened to the last slice of pumpkin pie, do you? $[Day3/Rookery/Partner_12]
{@Player}   Oh, uh… sorry. do you want some of my champurrado?  $[Day3/Rookery/Player_7]

$call CreateGoal("Day3_nests", Scan nests)

:: WarpedToRookeryGate
@trigger    AtWarpPoint
@who        Player
@when       targetObject == "WarpTarget-RookeryMiddle"
@once

{@Margo}    Use my Interact mode to take a look at the nests.   $[Day3/Rookery/Margo_1]
{@Margo}    We need to see how many eggs are hatched and if any are missing.    $[Day3/Rookery/Margo_2]

:: OnWinstonWendyIdentified
@function	TabletIdentified
@when		objectId == "WinstonWendyChick"
$set	chapter:identifiedCount + 1

{@Player}   Yes! Millie and Billy have hatched a healthy chick! $[Day3/Rookery/Player_8]
{@Margo}    Aw, good for them. Two years in a row!  $[Day3/Rookery/Margo_3]

:: OnAlfredoEggIdentified
@function	TabletIdentified
@when		objectId == "AlfredoEgg"
$set	chapter:identifiedCount + 1

//play egg hatching animation
{@Player}   Look, Alfredo’s egg is hatching!  $[Day3/Rookery/Player_9]
{@Margo}    Ooh. We better snag a video later.  $[Day3/Rookery/Margo_4]
{@Margo}    I betcha those’ll be the most famous Adelie chicks on Youtube.  $[Day3/Rookery/Margo_5]

:: OnFuzzEggIdentified
@function	TabletIdentified
@when		objectId == "FuzzEgg"
$set	chapter:identifiedCount + 1

{@Player}   Uh oh. Something’s not right here.  $[Day3/Rookery/Player_10]
{@Player}    Maybe the eggs aren’t ready yet?  $[Day3/Rookery/Player_11]
{@Margo}    I don’t know, kid.  $[Day3/Rookery/Margo_6]
{@Margo}    Looks like Daisy’s out gettin’ some food. It’s all up to Fuzz here. $[Day3/Rookery/Margo_7]
{@Margo}    He’s not warmin’ the egg like he’s supposed to. And it’s awful cold out here.  $[Day3/Rookery/Margo_8]
{@Player}   He’s brand new at this. Maybe he’ll figure it out.  $[Day3/Rookery/Player_12]
{@Margo}    Well, he’d better hurry. Those eggs are gonna freeze fast.  $[Day3/Rookery/Margo_9]

:: OnMillieBillyIdentified
@function	TabletIdentified
@when		objectId == "MillieBillyChick"
$set	chapter:identifiedCount + 1

{@Player}   Nice. A new chick for Winston and Wendy! $[Day3/Rookery/Player_13]
{@Margo}    No surprise there. There’s a reason we call them “Old Faithful.”  $[Day3/Rookery/Margo_10]
{@Margo}    Winston and Wendy have had a successful chick every year.  $[Day3/Rookery/Margo_11]
{@Player}   Wow. Penguin Parents of the Year award! Keep it up, you two.    $[Day3/Rookery/Player_14]

:: OnPoloNestIdentified
@function	TabletIdentified
@when		objectId == "PoloNest"
$set	chapter:identifiedCount + 1

{@Player}   Whoa, wait a second. Weren’t there an egg here yesterday?   $[Day3/Rookery/Player_15]
{@Player}   What happened to the egg?   $[Day3/Rookery/Player_16]
{@Margo}    Oh no. Poor Polo.   $[Day3/Rookery/Margo_12]
{@Margo}    The skua must’ve been here. $[Day3/Rookery/Margo_13]
{@Player}   You mean . . . the egg is gone?  $[Day3/Rookery/Player_17]


:: WarpedToRookeryGate
@trigger    AtWarpPoint
@who        Player
@when       targetObject == "WarpTarget-RookeryBack"
@once



:: ObjectiveCompleted
@trigger	ObjectiveCompleted
@who		Player
@once
@interrupt

$set	chapter:finishedObservations = true
$call ClearGoals()

$call Wait(0.3)
{@Partner}  Great! You can head back to the overlook now.   $[Day3/Rookery/Partner_2]

$call CreateGoal("Day3_return", Return to tent)

:: WarpedBackToTent
@trigger    AtWarpPoint
@who        Player
@when       chapter:finishedObservations, targetObject == "WarpTarget-Bluff-Back"
@once

$call Wait(1)

$call SetWarpActive(WarpBluffBack, false)
$call SetWarpGroupActive(Rookery, false)
$call SetWarpActive(WarpDesk, true)

{@Margo} Let's get back in the tent and upload that data!   $[Day3/Bluff/Margo_3]

$call CreateGoal("Day3_upload", Upload Margo's data)

:: WarpedInsideTent
@trigger    AtWarpPoint
@who        Player
@when       chapter:finishedObservations, targetObject == "WarpTarget-Desk"
@interrupt

$call CompleteGoal("Day3_return")
$call Wait(1)
$call SetWarpActive(WarpDesk, true)

{@Margo}    Okay, kiddo. Put me in the dock and let’s have a look at our findings! $[Day3/Tent/Margo_5]

$while !IsSocketedBy(DeskDock, Margo)
$call Wait(0.5)
$endwhile

$while !ButtonPressed(BigButton)
$call Wait(0.5)
$endwhile

{@Margo}    You've got three successful breeding pairs. $[Day3/Tent/Margo_6]
{@Margo}    Millie and Billy, Alfredo and Meatball, and Winston and Wendy.  $[Day3/Tent/Margo_7]
{@Margo}    All the chicks seem to be doing well so far.    $[Day3/Tent/Margo_8]
{@Margo}    Fuzz and Daisy's egg isnt lookin' too good.     $[Day3/Tent/Margo_9]
{@Margo}    Fuzz hasn't figured out how to keep it warm... I've got a bad feelin' that we won't see their egg hatch.    $[Day3/Tent/Margo_10]
{@Margo}    Polo and Benni lost their chick.    $[Day3/Tent/Margo_11]
{@Margo}    All the parents are feedin' their little ones krill, which is what we'd expect to see this time of year.    $[Day3/Tent/Margo_12]
{@Margo}    A month from now, the chicks should be waddlin' around on their own...  $[Day3/Tent/Margo_13]
{@Margo}    Assuming the skua don't get to 'em first.   $[Day3/Tent/Margo_14]
{@Margo}    Nice work, kid. Another good day's work!    $[Day3/Tent/Margo_15]

$call CompleteGoal("Day3_upload")
